From: NixOS Orange Pi Zero 2W configuration
Subject: uwe5622: Avoid null loopcheck dereference before WCN probe

Return an initialization error when the WCN proc state is not ready instead
of dereferencing it. This keeps a failed radio probe from faulting the kernel
and breaking subsequent reboot.

---
 drivers/net/wireless/uwe5622/unisocwcn/platform/wcn_procfs.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/uwe5622/unisocwcn/platform/wcn_procfs.c b/drivers/net/wireless/uwe5622/unisocwcn/platform/wcn_procfs.c
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/uwe5622/unisocwcn/platform/wcn_procfs.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/uwe5622/unisocwcn/platform/wcn_procfs.c
@@ -1245,5 +1245,7 @@ void proc_fs_exit(void)
 
 int get_loopcheck_status(void)
 {
+	if (!mdbg_proc)
+		return -ENODEV;
 	return mdbg_proc->fail_count;
 }
-- 
2.51.0
